201	     *  the sheet's clerk limit (a due of n/a is within any limit) puts it PENDING instead, for a steward to
202	     *  approve or reject; its due stays live. Settling fixes the
203	     *  claim's due at its grade's rate in force on its date (a claim bound by a statement at the figure it
204	     *  bound), its late charge on the sheet's today frozen in on top; with no figure then, its due stays live. */
